    "scenesThatPass": [
      "LUCY: Ten years.\nELDERLY REPORTER: Ten years?! Jesus Christ. I'll be dead by then!",
      "MIJA: Wait!\nRECEPTIONIST: Oh my God! Are you okay?",
      "JENNIFER: Right! The Best Super Pig Fest will continue as planned!\nLUCY: I know what they call me. They call me a psychopath.\nJENNIFER: YOU'RE not a psychopath! THEY'RE the psychopaths, right, Ms. Mirando? They're narcissists.\nLUCY: Do narcissists wear balaclavas?",
      "LUCY: While my sister was dumping so much toxic waste into Moose Lake it EXPLODED... the only lake ever to explode, well done, Nancy... I was visu…\nLUCY: I took science...\nLUCY: And nature...\nLUCY: And I synthesized.",
      "LUCY: And there it is! The image that's going to destroy us! Who are those idiots?\nLUCY: Find out and fire them.\nJENNIFER: Sure! Leave it with me!\nLUCY: Abusing that adorable girl in the uniforms I personally designed! What are we famous for?"
    ]
